        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer LB8024-045R  4-1/2\"  Heavy Duty Swing Clear Hinge</b>\r\n<p>\r\nHeavy duty .180\" thickness lube bearing swing clear hinge. Standard full mortise hinge with 3 knuckle design. For heavy doors / high frequency use doors with square door edge. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/bommer-LB8024-045-hinge_size.gif?v=1704442277\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer LB8024-045R Swing Clear Hinge\"> \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSwing clear hinges are used when conditions require the door to completely clear the opening at 90 degrees. ADA compliant and made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Bommer  LB8024-045R Swing Clear Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Lube Bearing for Smooth Action</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.180\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>BHMA Certified Hinge</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>For Square Door Edge</li>\r\n<li>Non-Rising Removable Pin</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise - Conforms to ANSI A5121</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BB5024-045.pdf?v=1691094995\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer LB8024-045R Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer Hinges made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with matching finish machine screws and wood screws. For use with both metal and wood  doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually (1 door hinge)</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b><br>\r\n**These hinges are normally special order 3-5 weeks to ship.\r\n</b>\r\n</p>",
